Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,大开杀戒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡飞车 全球最火爆的比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death Race, the number one sport in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.07,0:00:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,在终端岛举行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}located on Terminal Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.31,0:00:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,历时三天的严酷比赛 罪犯们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Convicts race over the course of three grueling days
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.51,0:00:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为那个终极大奖而厮杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the chance at the ultimate prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,赢得五场比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Win five races,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,赢取他的自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}win your freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,抢先预定下一场死亡飞车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preorder the next Death Race now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.29,0:00:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,您将不仅得到八折优惠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you'll not only get 20% off,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.09,0:01:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,更将获得限量版Frankenstein纪念商品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you'll also receive limited edition Frankenstein merchandise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankenstein 四场死亡飞车比赛的冠军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein, the four-time Death Race champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,已风靡全球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has taken the world by storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这位名不经转车手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The most unlikely of heroes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.30,0:01:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不可思议的出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has come out of nowhere
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.73,0:01:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,再赢一场比赛 他就将重获自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and is now just one win away from freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡飞车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.44,0:01:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,正在直播{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now streaming live.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡飞车是Weyland国际集团的注册商标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death Race is the trademark of Weyland International.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.35,0:01:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,您的安全是我们的首要目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your safety's our top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,臭名昭著的死亡飞车选手Frankenstein{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The notorious Death Racer known only as Frankenstein
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.69,0:01:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,今天赢得了个人第四场胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}won his fourth race today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.19,0:01:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,再赢一场 这位戴着面具的杀手将获得自己的自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more victory and the masked killer gains his freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.53,0:01:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,无所畏惧的Frankenstein{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein fears nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,挡其道者 尽诛之{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything in his way, he destroys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.27,0:01:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在我的经营下 终端岛和死亡飞车正不断发展{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under my watch, Terminal Island and Death Race have thrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.84,0:01:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有传言称 举办死亡飞车比赛的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rumors have been going around that Weyland International,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.48,0:01:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Weyland国际集团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the organization behind Death Race,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,将被恶意收购{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has been targeted for hostile takeover.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.82,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,对于商人来说 被收购早已习以为常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a businessman, takeover talk is common.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,手握值钱的东西 自然有人想要夺走它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have something of value, naturally, people want to take it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.79,0:02:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,英国亿万富翁 Niles York{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}British billionaire, Niles York,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.86,0:02:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,已将自己置于风口浪尖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has placed himself in the center of a firestorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,眼下的舆论我暂时不做评价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've got nothing to say about that at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但我说一句{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I will say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我想得到任何东西 没有一个人能阻止我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I want something, no one can stop me from taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.61,0:02:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不担心 我赢下的从来比输掉的多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not too concerned. I've won more battles than I've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.77,0:02:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我真替Weyland可惜 真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel bad for Weyland, I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但岁月不饶人啊 他已经不行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Father Time, he's caught up with the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无还手之力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He never really stood a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.85,0:02:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,《死亡飞车3：地狱烈焰》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.66,0:02:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 Weyland先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Mr. Weyland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.30,0:02:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,也没那么糟糕 是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wasn't so bad, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.57,0:02:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这节目是我起的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I built this business.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我没必要来偷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't have to steal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我抓住了你的弱点 我不是偷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you left vulnerable, I seized. I stole nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.45,0:03:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有眼界 Weyland 这是你的祸根{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lacked vision, Weyland. That was your undoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,眼界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你给全世界各种荒废的监狱投资百万的原因吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that why you're investing millions in dilapidated prisons all around the globe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,眼界?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vision?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你都昏了头 把自己埋进地下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so far over your head, you might as well be six feet under the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.67,0:03:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,监狱产业不是这个公司盈利的项目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The prison business is not what made this company profitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.41,0:03:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你的目的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the conclusion to draw,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你想把死亡飞车做成全球联锁的节目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're trying to franchise Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.65,0:03:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没戏的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.39,0:03:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你没做成吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you couldn't make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,给你看看我们未来的伟大宏图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me show you what true vision really looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.27,0:04:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你起了个好头 Weyland{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You started something beautiful, Weyland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但你只做了皮毛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you only scratched at the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你说对了 我是想把死亡飞车推向全球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're right. I'm taking Death Race global.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一年之内 每两周就会有一场比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By this time next year, there will be a different race every two weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在一个地狱般的地方举行 不同的车手不同的赛道和挑战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at a different exotic hellhole with different drivers, tracks and challenges.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.39,0:04:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我会垄断这个星球上 有史以来最赚钱的体育运动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will have a monopoly on the most profitable sport in the history of the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.56,0:04:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,更多车 更多罪犯 更多火拼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More cars. More cons. More guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,更多的死亡 没有极限{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More death. The sky's the limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但 你忘了一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you forgot one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还有Frankenstein{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.54,0:04:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个戴面具的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a man in a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.71,0:04:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我能找20个Frankenstein出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have 20 Frankensteins around the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.92,0:04:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,观众怎么知道哪个才是真的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How would the fans know which one was real?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankenstein今天赢了第四场比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein won his fourth race today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,再赢一场 他就自由了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more win, he goes free.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这是每一个观众都知道的事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a fact that every fan knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在要是突然改变比赛规则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if you suddenly change the rules of the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.93,0:05:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你就留不住观众了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're going to lose your audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你指望Frankenstein会输{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you're hoping that Frankenstein loses,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我想他之前还没输过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well, son, I guess there's a first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如此一来 没有他 你这拷贝不走样的节目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, how would your little copycat event play
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.41,0:05:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么继续下去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without the game's marquee star?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.91,0:05:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你注定失败的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you're going to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Weyland 你抽什么牌子的雪茄?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of cigars you smoke, Weyland?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.39,0:05:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,等死亡飞车享誉全球的时候 我一定会给你寄上一盒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be sure to send you a box when Death Race becomes a global success.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.49,0:05:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我就会第二次打败你 也是你又一次输给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be the second time I've beaten you. The second time you've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那 趁有机会的时候好好享受吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you enjoy your moment while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.90,0:05:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这结局你不会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Payback's a bitch, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Weyland没说错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,给我查那个面具背后的人是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find out who the man behind the mask really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.55,0:05:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他的所爱所憎 最觊觎什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What he loves, what he hates, what he covets most.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,还有Weyland下一步计划是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And find out what Weyland was planning next.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:05:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.85,0:05:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他公司一周内为了做Frankenstein联锁产业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The company's banking nearly eight million quid a week
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,投了将近800万{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hawking Frankenstein merchandise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会轻易放手的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't just gonna let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.89,0:06:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,还有别的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,有 给自己买点像样的衣服 你看上去就像个捡破烂的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Get yourself some decent clothes. You look like a bag lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我热爱死亡飞车 我都不会出现在这里 做这笔买卖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't be here, I wouldn't have done all this unless I absolutely loved Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我要告诉全世界 数以万计死亡飞车的铁杆观众{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm speaking to the millions of fans around the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心 我和大家一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear not. I am like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.41,0:06:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会破坏或者牺牲我们所恪守的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I seek not to destroy nor to compromise what we've all come to revere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.78,0:06:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们所知和所爱的死亡飞车不会改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Death Race that we all know and love will not change.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,它会变得更壮大更完美 这 我向大家保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will grow bigger and better. This, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.49,0:06:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢各位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.03,0:06:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,总体来说我很满意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Overall, I have to say I'm very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.73,0:06:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你想看看吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna take a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不必了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们明天再做一些测试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll run a few more tests tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.57,0:06:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你就能回到正常生活了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're back to your old self in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,其实不然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他会变得更好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:06:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,都听到了吧 出去喝杯咖啡吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard the man. Take a coffee break, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.85,0:07:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,看来 传言是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I guess the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.89,0:07:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 你也不会为我惋惜吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and I guess you won't be shedding any tears for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.06,0:07:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Carl 你和我 这辈子走过的路完全不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you and I, Carl, we've taken very different paths in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但却都走到了这一步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we both ended up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.07,0:07:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是我坐在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,而你是来去自如 可以见自己爱的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come and go as you please, see the ones you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也见得到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别拿我们做比较 Weyland 你丢了公司{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't compare us, Weyland. You lost the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.45,0:07:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我丢了生活  - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I lost my life.  - Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我还修好了你的脸 给你一条出路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and I also fixed your face and I gave you a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 告诉我你会信守诺言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me and tell me you were gonna keep your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Weyland 我不傻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not stupid, Weyland.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是出于良心才帮我整容的 是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you didn't fix my face out of the kindness of your heart, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.13,0:07:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我伤口已经感染了 我就要死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was infected. I was gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你的明星车手就要没了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you would have lost your star driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊你没这么坏 你只是更毒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you're not so bad. You're worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:08:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我相信你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you want me to trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.98,0:08:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在深陷泥潭就是活该{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You deserve the shit-storm you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我有新消息 Carl{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I got news for you, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.15,0:08:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经逃不掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're already in waist-deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.79,0:08:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你是Frankenstein{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.56,0:08:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一切由你开始 由你结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This all starts and ends with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫Carl Lucas{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,自幼便入黑帮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Born a gangster,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.67,0:08:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,被囚于铁窗之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}became a prisoner,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 他已是一个禽兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now, a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,愿他安息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May he rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你和你的团队赢五场比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and your team win five races
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就能获得自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you go free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Goldberg 以及Lists{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goldberg, Lists
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,还有那个美丽动人的Katrina{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that beautiful, beautiful Katrina.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 为了你们成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, for this to work,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能告诉别人你的真实身份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can't tell your true identity to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.31,0:09:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Carl Lucas已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl Lucas stays dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.65,0:09:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你是Frankenstein{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.95,0:09:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不用客气 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're welcome, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了四场 一个谢谢都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four wins and not even a thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.35,0:09:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一切由你开始 由你结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This all starts and ends with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.97,0:10:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了 就是他啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is. There's the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你转狱了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having you transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.31,0:10:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去南非的Kalahari沙漠最高戒备监狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're headed to the Kalahari Desert Maximum Security Penitentiary
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,去完成第一场沙漠死亡飞车比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in South Africa where you will compete in the first ever Desert Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.95,0:10:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哦? 会给我配自己的沙漠越野车吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. What do I get, my own dune buggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,只不过是借你去Kalahari{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just on loan to the Kalahari
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.19,0:10:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,帮着开各种死亡飞车国际赛的第一场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to help launch the first of what will be many international Death Races.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.19,0:10:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会带上14K 还有你的团队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're sending 14K, as well as both your teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.93,0:10:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,看来得更新我的护照了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm guessing I should get my passport updated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.27,0:10:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你貌似不把我当回事儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get the feeling that you are not taking me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.30,0:10:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我不把你当回事儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's because I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.40,0:10:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我和Weyland说好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. I made a deal with Weyland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.34,0:10:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我再赢一场 我 还有我的团队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I win one more race, me, my team,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.31,0:10:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,都能出狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.18,0:10:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道 Weyland的事挺可惜的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, you know, it's a pity about Weyland,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你和他做的交易都不作数了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because all deals with him are null and void.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.18,0:10:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你帮我办事 我的规矩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You work for me now. New rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.89,0:10:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,做梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:11:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我想不是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没人给你选吧 你要不想开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have a choice, mate. But if you don't want to drive,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我用你的血 把我飞机喷成红色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will paint my plane red with your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Niles?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.27,0:11:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么打算 找人替我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do, replace me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,找谁呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你担心什么? 你已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you care? You're already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 只要你活着 你就会有明星的待遇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, as long as you're alive, you'll be treated like the star that you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.72,0:11:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,或者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.42,0:11:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我轻而易举地打乱你的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could just simply fuck up your little plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧 只要再赢一场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}couldn't I, by winning one more race
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我就自由了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈 你不会过终点的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. You'll never make it to the finish line, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,输掉比赛 你活下去 赢了比赛 你见鬼去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lose, you live. You win, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.99,0:12:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,(南非)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.19,0:13:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快 下车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.05,0:13:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 走起来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,把那手提钻拿来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring that jackhammer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.16,0:13:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,站好队伍! 快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the line! Get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,大家快看呐!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, take a look at those!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.97,0:13:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快点走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move your fuckin' arse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.01,0:13:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.87,0:14:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 Goldberg!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Goldberg!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.94,0:14:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是你啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是你们的铁杆车迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a big fan. But we've got our own bitches down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你还带自己的人来干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know why you brought yours along.
