Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.50,0:16:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,看来不管是什么交易 他们都答应帮你整容{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it was, it included getting your face fixed.
