Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还是你只看到了他们想让你看到的一面?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or did you just see what they wanted you to see?
