Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,接着走 不要停! 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving, don't stop! Come on!
