Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.86,0:25:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的十个人将作为明天赛事的领航员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten women remain who'll compete as navigatos in tomorrow's Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.00,0:25:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,场上选手均为暴力犯罪罪犯 请勿在家中模仿比赛镜头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fighters are convicted violent felons. Acts should not be duplicated at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.63,0:25:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点 Prudence 没什么可以害怕的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax, Prudence. There's nothing for you to fear here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.74,0:25:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然他们都是无恶不作的杀人犯强奸犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They may be ruthless, vicious murderers and rapists,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.77,0:25:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但你已经不够他们的兴奋点了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they've taste enough to ignore you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.58,0:25:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛开始啦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's race time, motherfuckers!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.99,0:26:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰我 今早的我感觉有些易碎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch me. I'm feeling a little fragile this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.73,0:26:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 出发了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.06,0:26:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.85,0:27:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,也很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.29,0:27:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快走!  - 好主意 不过我已经试过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, move!  - Good idea. But I already tried that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.63,0:27:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.70,0:27:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.33,0:27:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.67,0:27:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.64,0:27:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一个 下一个!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another one. Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.84,0:27:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,往我身体里打东西 你想干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think you're putting inside of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.35,0:27:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,松开他 他就是个办事儿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go. He's just doing what he's told to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.75,0:27:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,和终端岛不一样 这里没有围墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlike Terminal Island, there are no walls here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.72,0:27:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可不希望看到车手开了车逃之夭夭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't want our drivers dashing for their freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.96,0:27:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这个会实时告诉我们你们的确切位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will tell us exactly where you are at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.79,0:27:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那 我要是脱离了赛道 会发生什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I go off-course, what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.70,0:27:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你不熟悉德制Iris-T红外智能导弹吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not familiar with the German-made Iris-T Infra-red Smart missile?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.00,0:27:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.74,0:27:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你脱离赛道之后就熟悉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go off-course, and you will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.67,0:28:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就像Kalahari监狱不允许有逃犯一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just as there's no escape from Kalahari,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.94,0:28:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡飞车比赛也不允许有逃犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is no escape from Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.92,0:28:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还真不错啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, ain't that somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.32,0:28:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,York先生 我希望你知道 我会对你言听计从{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. York. While you are here, I want you to know that I am at your disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.83,0:28:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,任何你喜欢的东西 就是你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything your heart desires, consider yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.80,0:28:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,随便什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.74,0:28:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,请入座{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please do take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.21,0:28:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,来自南非Kalahari监狱的现场直播{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Streaming live from the Kalahari Prison in South Africa,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.88,0:28:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一个关押世上最凶残罪犯 从未被世人所知的监狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}home to the most ruthless and violent criminals the world has ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.06,0:28:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Niles York给大家带来 死亡飞车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Niles York presents Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.10,0:28:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,11位车手将进行为期三天的艰苦赛事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eleven drivers will compete over three brutal days
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.30,0:29:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,横穿地球上最可怕的地域之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}across one of the most dangerous terrains on Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.27,0:29:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就为争取一项终极大奖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a chance at the ultimate prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.11,0:29:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,获胜五场 重获自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Win five races, win your freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.35,0:29:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,喂Lists{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lists.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.29,0:29:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有喇叭和麦克风 所以没有耳麦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a speaker and mic here, so no more headsets.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.22,0:29:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但火控装置还在老地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the weapon trigger's still in the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.92,0:29:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.19,0:29:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不再有防御装备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no shields out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.96,0:29:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,只有用来攻击的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only offensive weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.10,0:29:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,激活武器的位置在地图上有标示 在表格这里有提示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapon locations are marked on the map, indicated here on the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.93,0:29:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但记住 你要开车穿过而不是压过 来激活武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, remember, you have to drive through, not over, to activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.41,0:29:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这会像巴哈拉力赛一样吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think this thing's gonna be like a Baja race?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.04,0:29:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我对巴哈的唯一印象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing I know about Baja,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.81,0:29:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那里的一种我喜欢的卷饼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a style of tacos I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.02,0:29:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿Goldberg{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goldberg,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.95,0:29:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这回我得要你帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna need you on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.36,0:29:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.43,0:30:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有三件事你要留心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three things you gotta worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.83,0:30:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,首先是Razor{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Razor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.10,0:30:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 选手Razor  - 比起在比赛了赢我们 他更想把我们杀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Razor.  - He'd rather kill us than win.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.57,0:30:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还有Nero{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nero.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.47,0:30:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 选手Nero  - 方格子旗和赢比赛毫无关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nero.  - Checkered flag has nothing to do with winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.38,0:30:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那第三个是什么呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. So what's the third?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.48,0:30:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,第三个嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Third,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.22,0:30:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个坐副驾驶的小妞了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's that beautiful girl sitting next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.93,0:30:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,准备在线直播{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get it ready for an online broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.17,0:30:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,大家紧密配合好 15号10号还有8号摄像机位准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's make a tight MCU. Camera 15,10 and eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.15,0:30:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.58,0:30:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.49,0:31:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说Katrina{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katrina.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.89,0:31:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,别 我不想听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't. I don't wanna hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.94,0:31:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的领航小妞啊 你说英语吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my nav-girl. You, do you speak English?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.55,0:31:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,当然会说 你个白痴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I speak English, you fucking idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.65,0:31:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,赢下这场再说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just fucking win this race.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.25,0:31:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不错 这下该爽了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, this is gonna be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.15,0:31:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,选手Joker{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.16,0:31:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,史上第一场这样的官方比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first official race of this kind
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.00,0:31:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,于1967年10月31号在下加利福尼亚的Tijuana鸣枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}started in Tijuana, Baja California on October 31st, 1967...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.47,0:31:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,被称作NORRA墨西哥1000拉力赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and was called the NORRA Mexican 1000 Rally.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.17,0:31:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,当年的赛道长度为849英里 也就是1366公里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The course length that year was 849 miles, or 1,366 kilometers,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.98,0:31:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,终点在南下加利福尼亚的La Paz{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and ended in La Paz, Baja California Sur, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.98,0:32:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,第一名总赛程耗时27小时38分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The overall winning time was 27 hours, 38 minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.58,0:32:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,冠军是驾驶Meyers Manx沙漠越野车的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}set by Vic Wilson and Ted Mangels
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.38,0:32:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Vic Wilson和Ted Mangels{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while driving a Meyers Manx buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.52,0:32:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你在和谁说话?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who're you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.29,0:32:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你想听点有关的历史故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought you'd appreciate some relative historical perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.29,0:32:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你想错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you thought wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.20,0:32:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,发车灯准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.47,0:32:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,10号摄像机 镜头往左{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number 10, pan to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.24,0:32:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,目光都聚焦在想赢得个人第五场比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All eyes are on Frankenstein, as he tries to win his fifth race
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.34,0:32:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,并第一个赢得自由的Frankenstein身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and become the first inmate to win his freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.38,0:32:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,神秘的Frankenstein在赢得个人前四场飞车战胜利后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mysterious Frankenstein became a worldwide phenomenon
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.58,0:32:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,成为了一个举世瞩目的传奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after winning his first four Death Races.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.18,0:32:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但那只是在终端岛上的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that was back on Terminal Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.69,0:32:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他能在非洲续写胜利的篇章吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can he repeat that success here in Africa?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.69,0:32:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,三{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.66,0:32:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在这三条沙漠赛道上 选手将要继续面对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unique challenges lay ahead as our drivers
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.59,0:32:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,终端岛封闭赛道上那样的挑战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}move from the confines of Terminal Island's track onto three desert courses.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.97,0:32:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,二{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.27,0:32:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,大屠杀即将开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The carnage is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.64,0:33:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.21,0:33:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他抢跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's jumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.55,0:33:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,有人抢跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a jumper.
