Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.38,1:04:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,想玩是不是? 了结吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you wanna play? Let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.35,1:04:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 艹!  - 该死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bitch!  - You fucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.92,1:04:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我受不了这人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man. I'm sick of this asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.63,1:05:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,别以为我看不到你了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see you, devil!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.98,1:05:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.69,1:06:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要干嘛? 别碰我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck are you doing? Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.64,1:06:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太美了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is just so fucking beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.72,1:06:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这 给Nero的赛程画上了句号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that marks the end of Nero.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.32,1:06:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,在这最后赛段 我们还剩下四位选手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As we enter the final stage, we're down to the final four.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.46,1:06:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,回程穿过Loeriesfontein到达终点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Driving back through Loeriesfontein to the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.30,1:06:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看看今天军阀们都有什么家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see what the warlords of Kalahari have in store today.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.32,1:07:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,武器激活装置已准备激活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapon markers ready for activation.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.13,1:07:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 有武器了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we're clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.19,1:07:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就激活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me weapons now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.25,1:07:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,抓好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.22,1:07:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,往哪里跑呢? 我们还没完呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's he going? We're not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.69,1:07:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你想干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.33,1:07:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.13,1:07:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.40,1:07:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's who doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.72,1:08:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你死定了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will die!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.80,1:08:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.84,1:08:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,为了救你的命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To save your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.48,1:08:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,走走走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.51,1:08:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有人跟上来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got company.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.12,1:08:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,该死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.62,1:08:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,二号摄像机 拍下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camera two, pick that up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.90,1:08:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.47,1:09:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人是谁啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the fuck are these people?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.37,1:09:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 我能搞定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.74,1:09:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,朝你来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming up behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.17,1:09:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧 混蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.52,1:09:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是棒极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is just fucking awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.15,1:09:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.33,1:09:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你跑不了的 混蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't run, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.48,1:09:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这个会很给力的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna be close.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.66,1:10:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What now, Luke?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.77,1:10:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.72,1:10:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,二号摄像机 推近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camera two, pan in.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.50,1:10:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,二号机 跟上啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camera two, move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.95,1:11:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这些镜头别丢了 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not lose that shot, boys. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.44,1:11:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,动作快 想把这镜头丢了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it, move it. Do you wanna miss the fucking shot?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.79,1:11:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,太赞了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.29,1:11:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,第二天的赛程以一场爆炸结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Day two concludes with a bang.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.36,1:11:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎明天继续回来 收看史诗般的大结局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tune in tomorrow for the epic conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.47,1:11:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,任何转播以及未经授权的使用者将被处以死刑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any rebroadcast or unauthorized use is punishable by death,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.84,1:11:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,小于15岁的将被处以终身监禁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or life in prison if under the age of 15.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.87,1:11:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不知道他有孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know he had a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.31,1:11:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,难以置信 居然对最亲近的人知之甚少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shocking how little we know about the ones closest to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.51,1:12:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我也一点不了解我的秘书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know virtually nothing about my secretary here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.41,1:12:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,相反 她知道我生活的每一面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conversely, she knows every aspect of my life,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.98,1:12:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,私人的 工作的 好的坏的 还有丑陋的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}personal, business, good, bad and ugly.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.79,1:12:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,转过来看着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around and face me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.93,1:12:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对于Goldberg的事情我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to hear about Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.04,1:12:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我都没听说过他 但我知道他对你团队的重要性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never knew the man, but I know how integral he was to your team.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.44,1:12:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你这种人怎么可能会知道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What possible understanding can a man like you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.51,1:12:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他岂止是团队的一份子 他是我的亲人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was more than just a part of my team. He was family.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.58,1:12:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.38,1:12:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不绕弯子 我们说好的还作数 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just to be clear, our deal still stands. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.49,1:12:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在不要被感情冲昏了头脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, don't let your emotions cloud your judgment.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.56,1:12:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,明天14K会赢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}14K will win tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.63,1:12:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你会落后完赛 官方说法是因为机械故障{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna stall out. Officially, mechanical failure resulted in your loss.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.43,1:12:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想大家觉得那是你的最高水准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want it to look like you were beat.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.80,1:12:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不能坏了你的名声啊 是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't damage your rep now, can we?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.57,1:12:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.84,1:12:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我问你问题 你就要回答 明白了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I ask you a question, you answer me. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.67,1:13:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不全明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.01,1:13:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你脑子里别惦记什么赢比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now get these foolish thoughts of winning out of your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.04,1:13:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你明天会输 不然天助我也{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will lose tomorrow, or so help me God,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.08,1:13:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我把你关进我能找到的最黑最阴暗的牢房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will put you in the deepest, darkest cell I can find.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.68,1:13:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你被关在里面 为那个死了的机械师哭鼻子的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And while you're down there, crying about that dead spic,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.59,1:13:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好好想想我会怎么处理你的小妞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just imagine what I'll be doing to your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.09,1:13:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想多了  - 你想怎么样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bad idea.  - What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.89,1:13:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 威胁杀了我?  - 其实不然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Threaten to kill me?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.49,1:13:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你错了 Niles{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Niles.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.03,1:13:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这样你就解脱得太轻松了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be letting you off too easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.17,1:13:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你能活过明天 但是你不能赢比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can live tomorrow, but you can't win.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.54,1:13:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,大概吧 目测你得把眼睛睁睁大吧? 和所有人一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe. Guess you'll just have to tune in, huh? Like everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.46,1:14:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 我得跟你悄悄地说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no. I need to talk in private.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.48,1:14:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我能听到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.58,1:14:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,想跟我说什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there something you wanna say to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.62,1:14:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是在想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just wondering
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.62,1:14:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是原来的那个Frankenstein{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you are the original Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.86,1:14:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.49,1:14:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你想想啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.86,1:14:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,面具背后到底是谁呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is the man behind the mask?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.83,1:14:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯? 有人知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm? Does anybody know?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.57,1:14:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就是要一个禽兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just want the monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.97,1:14:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可以像杀别人一样把你弄死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they can take you out in a way that would kill a normal human being,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.48,1:14:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,转身就把你的衣服给另一个人套上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then just slap the suit on the next guy and hey, presto.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.88,1:14:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankenstein又活了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.48,1:14:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他们会杀了我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think they're gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.99,1:14:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不 Frankenstein永远不会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Frankenstein can never die.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.99,1:15:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他可以被枪杀 出车祸葬身火海 被炸身亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can be shot. He can crash and burn. He can explode.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.76,1:15:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但Frankenstein总能复出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Frankenstein will always emerge.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.50,1:15:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也许受尽摧残 但总是活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Battered and bruised, maybe. But alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.17,1:15:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,只是不断续写他的神话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just makes his legend even greater.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.02,1:15:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 是的 他和我说话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Yes, he spoke to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.95,1:15:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.56,1:15:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.59,1:15:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这 是我的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my business.
