Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.67,1:26:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我来杀你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.30,1:26:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,亲自过来把你做了 听到了吗 Niles?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Personally coming to kill you. You hear me, Niles?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.77,1:26:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,把广播都打开 都打开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open all mics. Open all mics!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.51,1:26:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,守卫们 请注意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention, guards.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.44,1:26:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankenstein正朝终点过来 杀了他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein is headed to the finish line. Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.75,1:26:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,懦夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're such a coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.56,1:26:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,出去 出去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out, out!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.53,1:26:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你说对了 他把我耍了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right. He screwed me over.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.73,1:26:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前该听你的 你想让我怎么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have listened to you before. What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.78,1:27:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.73,1:27:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,打死他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.02,1:27:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,快 射击!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.96,1:27:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.70,1:27:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,该死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.77,1:28:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.88,1:28:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我会让一个劳改犯 毁了我造就的一切吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I'm gonna let a simple fucking con ruin everything that I've built?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.02,1:28:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankenstein直逼终点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein has a clear path to the finish.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.69,1:28:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他就要赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's about to win.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.73,1:28:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,14K 超过了Frankenstein 冲过了终点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}14K pulls past Frankenstein and crosses the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.46,1:28:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.53,1:28:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,14K赢得了本场比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}14K wins the Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.74,1:28:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,该你赢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could've won that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.37,1:28:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 但输赢已经不重要了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. It's not about winning races anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.04,1:28:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他输了 哈哈 都结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lost. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.38,1:28:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不玩儿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more games.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.98,1:28:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,别高兴太早{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.59,1:29:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.69,1:29:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.10,1:29:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.60,1:29:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,丫头 外面见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you on the other side, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.38,1:29:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我要亲手杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna take him out myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.81,1:29:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.75,1:29:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你哪儿也别去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You aren't going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.12,1:29:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我... 把钥匙给我!  - 和你的节目一起去死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- WTF... Give me the key!  - This is your production. It's quite fitting that you go down with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.73,1:30:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,把这东西弄开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get this fucking thing off me!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.67,1:30:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常遗憾地宣布 Niles York已经死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my sad duty to announce the death of Niles York.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.48,1:30:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这位充满理想的企业家带给了我们死亡飞车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The visionary entrepreneur who brought Death Race to us,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.95,1:30:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,却在比赛的最后一天遇害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}died in an explosion that also claimed the life of Katrina Banks
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.98,1:31:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸也夺走了Katrina Banks的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on this third and final day of competition.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.62,1:31:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们向York先生的家人和朋友表达最诚挚的哀悼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd like to extend our deepest sympathies to Mr. York's family and friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.53,1:31:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还有人活着!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.46,1:31:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他真是Frankenstein吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this really Frankenstein?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.66,1:31:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 他是Frankenstein{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Yes, it is Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.53,1:31:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,追踪装置确认了他的身份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tracking device confirms it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.53,1:31:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我可以确认Frankenstein在爆炸中幸存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, yes. I can confirm that Frankenstein has survived
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.97,1:31:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,并正在返回终端岛的途中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and is currently en route back to Terminal Island.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.04,1:31:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我把重建死亡飞车比赛的任务交给各位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I leave the task of rebuilding Death Race in your very capable hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.72,1:31:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡飞车的家 就是终端岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death Race's home is Terminal Island.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.52,1:31:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不再会是别的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nowhere else.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.56,1:31:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经为Frankenstein重新选择了团队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've arranged a new pit crew leader for Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.70,1:31:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的信息都在你们面前的资料里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have his information in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.53,1:31:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是的是的 这些都没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, yes, that's all well and good.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.50,1:31:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但Frankenstein怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what of Frankenstein?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.97,1:31:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我获悉Frankenstein已脱离昏迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been informed that Frankenstein is alert,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.21,1:31:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,意识清醒 将在两周后出战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}conscious, and will be ready to race in two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.21,1:32:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.58,1:32:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.98,1:32:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他醒过来一直在叫 说胡话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just woke up screaming, rambling a bunch of nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.72,1:32:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是Frankenstein!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not Frankenstein!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.69,1:32:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他明显还受着大量的刺激{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's obviously still in shock.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.59,1:32:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找他的朋友来安抚他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We brought his friend down to calm him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.66,1:32:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Frank吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.20,1:32:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈再说一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the last fucking time,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.27,1:32:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是Frankenstein{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.14,1:32:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're absolutely sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.08,1:32:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是他 但我从没见过他这个样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him all right. But I've never seen him like that before.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.02,1:32:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Prudence 告诉他们 告诉他们我是谁 我是Niles York{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prudence, tell them. Tell them who I am. I'm Niles York.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.19,1:32:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是Frankenstein!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not Frankenstein!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.82,1:32:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.31,1:33:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝儿 你好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.34,1:33:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,还好吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.11,1:33:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.58,1:33:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.35,1:33:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 小鸳鸯们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, lovebirds.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.02,1:33:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来都这么可靠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can always rely on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.12,1:33:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为Lists干杯  - 为Lists干杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To Lists.  - To Lists.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.67,1:33:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,收到我的汇款了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get my wire?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.67,1:33:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我在看呢 真是太...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm looking at it right now. It's very...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.04,1:33:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太大方了 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very generous. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.21,1:33:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,冲着你把那混蛋害这么惨 我都会付三倍的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what you did to that bastard, I would have paid triple.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.68,1:33:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,之前可没说啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if I'd known that.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.38,1:33:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为是计划要把他弄死呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought the plan was to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.95,1:33:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,计划赶不上变化 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, things change, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.15,1:33:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,个人认为 这比杀了他更到位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Personally, I think I did better than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.09,1:33:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有异议吗?  - 哪里哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you complaining?  - Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.29,1:33:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did you pull it off?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.96,1:34:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那混蛋把你害惨了 是不是?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That son of a bitch screwed you over, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.17,1:34:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你做这个 只有一个条件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do this, one condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.90,1:34:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我和他做了个交易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made a deal with the guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.71,1:34:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你输了你活下去 你赢了你见鬼去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lose, you live. You win, you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.71,1:34:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有些事情得告诉大家 我的确做了笔交易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something you all need to know. I did make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.01,1:34:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,和我们前一任老板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With our old boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.38,1:34:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Weyland吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.12,1:34:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我还指望他来讨价还价 但他没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I expected him to at least renegotiate. But he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.15,1:34:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别小瞧他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not underestimate him.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.92,1:34:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他有自己的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's planning something.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.39,1:34:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,按我的做法 用我的规矩和我的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My way, my rules, my plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.20,1:34:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你帮个大忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna need something very important from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.77,1:34:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.00,1:34:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我得杀了你 Goldberg{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna need to kill you, Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.17,1:34:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是Kalahari的军阀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're the warlords of Kalahari.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.27,1:34:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我要让这些军阀卷入比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm gonna bring these warlords into the race.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.88,1:34:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.01,1:34:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's who doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.22,1:34:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,趁大家都在看比赛的时候 我要你自杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While everybody's watching, I'm gonna need you to take yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.02,1:34:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我要一个信号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna need a signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.96,1:34:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要很响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.86,1:35:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you need me to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.23,1:35:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要找个内应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need someone on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.27,1:35:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.94,1:35:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,安全了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The coast is clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.77,1:35:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,对那个机械师的死我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to hear about that dead spic.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.18,1:35:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的节目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my production.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.08,1:35:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.15,1:35:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,出去 出去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out, out!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.42,1:35:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他把我耍了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He screwed me over.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.82,1:35:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前该听你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have listened to you before.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.79,1:35:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankenstein朝终点来了 杀了他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein is headed to the finish line. Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.29,1:35:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,为了你自己 现在听我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do yourself a favor and listen to me right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.16,1:35:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我要亲手杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna take him out myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.49,1:35:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我怎么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.00,1:35:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,把他困在房间里 不择手段{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep him in the room. No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.00,1:35:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙给我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fucking key!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.18,1:35:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡飞车有它的终极大奖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death Race has the ultimate prize.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.35,1:35:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你能赢得你的自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You win your freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.22,1:36:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一切由Frankenstein开始 一切由他结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This all starts and ends with Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.89,1:36:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还有人活着!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.10,1:36:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是在想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just wondering
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.23,1:36:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你是原来那个Frankenstein{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you are the original Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.50,1:36:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是 他是Frankenstein{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it is Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.04,1:36:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,追踪装饰证实是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tracking deve confirms it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.04,1:36:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankenstein永远不会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein can never die.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.21,1:36:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他可以被枪杀 出车祸葬身火海 被炸身亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can be shot. He can crash and burn. He can explode.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.91,1:36:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但Frankenstein总能复出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Frankenstein will always emerge.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.26,1:36:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankenstein 他就是死亡飞车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein, he is Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.16,1:36:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Carl Lucas 愿他安息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl Lucas, may he rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.84,1:36:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 安全了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Psst! The coast is clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.26,1:37:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我不走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.03,1:37:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫你不走了? 你必须跟我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about you're not going? You have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.53,1:37:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来适应不了外面的日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was never any good out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.03,1:37:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,弄不懂那些世故{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't understand the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.10,1:37:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,只有监狱里 才有我弄得懂的规矩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In prison, things make sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.91,1:37:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 总得有人垫后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, plus, someone has to stay behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.51,1:37:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要一个目击证人来说故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A witness to tell the tale.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.91,1:37:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么做不符合逻辑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you're doing isn't logical.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.15,1:37:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.18,1:37:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有人曾和我说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone once told me,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.19,1:37:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,去他妈的逻辑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fuck logic.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.42,1:37:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,让你的心告诉你该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let your heart tell you what's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.39,1:38:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我和Weyland谈过 我来帮你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spoke to Weyland. I'm here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.30,1:38:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,平面图 电子系统 还有通风井的位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blueprints, electrical systems, ventilation shafts.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.94,1:38:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,如此一来 没有他 你这拷贝不走样的节目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, how would your little copycat event play
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.91,1:38:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么继续下去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without the game's marquee star?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.61,1:38:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个戴着面具的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a man in a mask.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.25,1:38:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,观众怎么会知道哪个才是真的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How would the fans know which one was real?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.12,1:38:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你会失败的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you're going to fail.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.96,1:38:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,年轻的亿万富翁会变成一个笑话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boy wonder billionaire will become the laughing stock.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.33,1:38:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你们所知和所爱的死亡飞车不会被改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Death Race that you all know and love will not change.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.06,1:39:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,它会变得更壮大更完美 这 我向大家保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will grow bigger and better. This, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.47,1:39:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在要是突然改变比赛规则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if you suddenly change the rules of the game,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.94,1:39:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你就留不住观众了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're going to lose your audience.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.37,1:39:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么打算 找人替我? 找谁呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do, replace me? With who?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.61,1:39:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这结局你不会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Payback's a bitch, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.55,1:39:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Frankenstein{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.95,1:39:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我会复仇的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I will have my revenge.
